SUMMARY:Deadline: Harry Ransom Center Research Fellowships 2027-2028 (Austi
 n\, Texas)
DESCRIPTION:The Harry Ransom Center at The University of Texas at Austin aw
 ards research fellowships for on-site work in its collections spanning lit
 erature\, photography\, film\, art\, performing arts\, music and cultural 
 history\, supporting scholarly articles\, dissertations\, creative works\,
  digital humanities projects and exhibition proposals.\n\nOrganisation: Ha
 rry Ransom Center\, The University of Texas at Austin\nLocation: Austin\, 
 Texas\, USA. On-site research in the Ransom Center's collections\; interna
 tional applicants welcome and receive an additional one-time USD 500 stipe
 nd for visa and travel costs.\nAward: Postdoctoral Fellowships: USD 3\,500
  per month for one or two months. Dissertation Fellowships: USD 2\,500. Tr
 avel Stipends: USD 2\,000 (open to graduate students\, faculty and indepen
 dent researchers including artists and journalists). International recipie
 nts get an extra USD 500. No application fee.\nDuration: One to two months
  on-site\, taken between 1 June 2027 and 31 August 2028.\n\nMore: https://
 www.hrc.utexas.edu/fellowships/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_
 medium=referral
URL:https://www.hrc.utexas.edu/fellowships/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugra
 ntdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Austin\, Texas\, USA. On-site research in the Ransom Center's coll
 ections\; international applicants welcome and receive an additional one-t
 ime USD 500 stipend for visa and travel costs.
END:VEVENT
